# Local dev keys and runtime state -- regenerated by `zt-adk keys init` and
# `zt-adk build`/a live run, the same as .env. The signed bundle itself
# (bundle/) is committed, deliberately NOT ignored below: it's generated,
# reviewable, reproducible from MANTIS's own live agent/tool graph, and a
# fresh clone shouldn't need to rebuild it just to use the toggle.
.zt/keys/
.zt/approver-keys/
.zt/state/
.zt_aml/keys/
.zt_aml/approver-keys/
.zt_aml/state/
